WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,750 --> 00:00:05,950
Don't you understand?

2
00:00:06,350 --> 00:00:07,510
I told you not to follow me

3
00:00:07,510 --> 00:00:10,410
I heard that there is nothing I can’t do

4
00:00:10,730 --> 00:00:14,160
it's my job for you

5
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:16,590
Is your brain made of wood?

6
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:24,440
If you must follow, then you will follow

7
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:25,520
Please stay away from me

8
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:26,520
ten meters away from me

9
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:28,720
I don’t want people to know that you’re following me, okay?

10
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:47,980
rush hour

11
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:49,540
Every ten minutes

12
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:50,780
Don't think about it

13
00:00:58,640 --> 00:01:01,720
I finally got rid of this bumpkin and went out to take a taxi.

14
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:02,960
Never go with him
